      <p><strong>Prerequisites</strong></p>
      <ul><li>You have a deployed Ingress Controller on a running cluster.</li></ul>
      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      Set the allowed source ranges API for the Ingress Controller by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc -n openshift-ingress-operator patch ingresscontroller/default \\\n    --type=merge --patch='{\"spec\":{\"endpointPublishingStrategy\": \\\n    {\"type\":\"LoadBalancerService\", \"loadbalancer\": \\\n    {\"scope\":\"External\", \"allowedSourceRanges\":[\"0.0.0.0/0\"]}}}}'"} lang="terminal" />
