      <ol>
      <li>
      Check that the <code>service.beta.kubernetes.io/load-balancer-source-ranges</code> is set by entering the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc get svc router-default -n openshift-ingress -o yaml"} lang="terminal" />
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  annotations:\n    service.beta.kubernetes.io/load-balancer-source-ranges: 192.168.0.1/32"} lang="yaml" title="Example output" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Check that the <code>spec.loadBalancerSourceRanges</code> parameter is unset by entering the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc get svc router-default -n openshift-ingress -o yaml"} lang="terminal" />
      <CodeBlock code={"...\nspec:\n  loadBalancerSourceRanges:\n  - 0.0.0.0/0\n..."} lang="yaml" title="Example output" />
      </li>
